---
// TrustBar.astro: 4 core value pillars from the Stitch UI design system
---

<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm py-space-lg border-y border-outline-variant/30">
  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-margin sm:px-margin-md">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-space-lg">
      
      <!-- 1. Rapid Arrival -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md p-space-xs">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px] text-primary">schedule</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">Arrivée en 30 Min</span>
          <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Dépannage d'urgence 24h/24 & 7j/7 sur Arlon</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Transparent Pricing -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md p-space-xs">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px] text-primary">payments</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">Prix Fixes & Clairs</span>
          <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Devis validé avant travaux, zéro frais caché</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Local Craftsmanship -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md p-space-xs">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px] text-primary">home_repair_service</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">15+ Ans de Métier</span>
          <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Artisans plombiers locaux de père en fils</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Warranty & Insurance -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md p-space-xs">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px] text-primary">verified_user</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">Agréé Assurances</span>
          <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Attestations dégât des eaux & garantie décennale</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
